      "title": "Room for Mystery",
      "year": 2024,
      "medium": "Oil on canvas",
      "description": "During my residency in January 2024 in Athens, immersed in the myths of the afterlife and the sacred rites of Elefsina, I set out to paint the erosion of time. But in the quiet of a museum hall, I found something else: a vessel, ancient, broken then unbroken, standing watch over memory and loss. 'The unseen road is longer than memory.'"
